<title>USA: Glenborough Realty Trust Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Glenborough Realty Trust Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dec 31  1996	  Dec 31    1995</p>
<p> Shr  profit		$0.19   profit	 $0.05</p>
<p> Net  profit		1,799   profit	   273</p>
<p> Revs			 7,466		    4,089</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr   loss		 $0.24   profit	 $0.66</p>
<p> Net   loss		 1,610   profit	 3,769</p>
<p> Revs			21,253		   16,428</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 year loss includes $6.1 million in consolidation costs, $1.2 million in litigation costs and $186,000 loss on debt refinancing.</p>
<p>Q4 funds from operations $0.39/shr vs $0.35, and for year $1.59 vs $1.53.</p>
</text>
